{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:30 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"上水警署男警疑吞槍 當場死亡\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1878e9108a6baca43c0e30cb14d8a69/2026-11/20261126_news_gun_si.png\"/><p>上水警署有警員吞槍死亡。今日（26日）早上10時54分，一名男警員在上水警署內懷疑使用佩槍自轟。救護員到場，經檢驗證實男警當場死亡。</p><p>現場消息稱，死者隸屬交通部，事發於洗手間內。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"上水警署有男警吞槍。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6e5a8596f26edc98263c4f91687b54a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_24_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f28c58d426d6dff503be349565d122fd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_24.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14c65fd740349b5ee266883fe8a7e7cb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b7a430913cf3fdfd2377f731b9fc04d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_22.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22fcec6481e8fa08dff9e533613d3fbb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_21.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62bb012ec5a6336845d33f5cbb31670c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_19_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a5beaa39841ff47beb8664c3a78f778/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"上水警署有男警吞槍，當場死亡。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f432b7a03533bb2320cc9b48c7d6253c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1120d0ed349b1467302eef61c4155c96/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-26_at_13_03_18.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.545315+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:30:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026